  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/11/IMG_1890.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La primera Fashion Night de Onda ha sido todo un &eacute;xito, con gran movimiento de gente por las calles, especialmente en el centro, las tiendas llenas y con mont&oacute;n de actividades, como el concierto de De Calle en Cinco Lobitos Moda Infantil y Juvenil, o la actuaci&oacute;n del d&uacute;o Twoo For Blues en Cafeteria Druida, que ha cerrado la noche.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fashionightonda15/img_1799.jpg\" alt=\"img_1799\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fashionightonda15/img_1800.jpg\" alt=\"img_1800\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fashionightonda15/img_1801.jpg\" alt=\"img_1801\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fashionightonda15/img_1802.jpg\" alt=\"img_1802\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fashionightonda15/img_1803.jpg\" alt=\"img_1803\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fashionightonda15/img_1804.jpg\" alt=\"img_1804\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fashionightonda15/img_1805.jpg\" alt=\"img_1805\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fashionightonda15/img_1806.jpg\" alt=\"img_1806\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fashionightonda15/img_1807.jpg\" alt=\"img_1807\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img sr